{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1583","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"科学探索是求真的事业，推动着人类文明的进步。在漫长的历史进程中，人类对自然的认识不断拓展，科学精神逐渐成为不同文化的共识。让我们热爱科学，走进科学的殿堂，崇尚科学，探索科学的奥秘。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元选入三篇文章，分为两组。《自然选择的证明》和《宇宙的边疆》阐明科学原理，介绍科学知识，引领我们了解自然，思考人类的未来；《天文学上的旷世之争》研讨科学史问题，追溯科学研究的历程。这些文章以不同的方式展现了人类探索自然、反思自我的成果。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学习自然科学论著，要注意感受论著中所体现的理性、严谨的科学精神；应掌握阅读自然科学论著的一般方法，注意抓住关键概念，梳理思路，把握逻辑，理解主要内容；体会自然科学论著的表述方式和语言特点，学习科学的思维方式和研究方法；结合理科课程的学习，拓展阅读，用恰当的方式呈现自己的学习成果。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":57578,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/3/35e9ae5c54f3256ce75e9548cd911fad171c36cb.jpeg","height":412,"id":"media-01bfb4e5051263dc0488","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"263b48ab0980aee8d6541da53b8c85ea00542604e32daa90c490ed03a44f92e7","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/3/35e9ae5c54f3256ce75e9548cd911fad171c36cb.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":818}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10558,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"http